AdpnODU_pvaOF0mUSz8aWwQzEOzIZTn_vTj59ovFDHGi1rE-tT4NtZScgNCDc9gGgqw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE3KAqp0FDjkGCWG2YJOJrHLYYqz4A2Q3IlHf11ckbuGA&oe=6A85ABF2"}, {"file_name": "\u622a\u5c4f2025-12-09 23.25.56.png", "id": "850674767657193", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618102_850674770990526_7422896971220087778_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xqi37XjJxFQQ7kNvwEQKZN9&_nc_oc=AdpnAXbISX9mMQfpjDmMKHM5KYYjArxyd1xnH2sGwgA8L-DAn0MoO5zvXSL3riFoYNA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGgibgeoMz1ISF1PXFjUW9Jj8njTxByiVtmTI3f00eNsA&oe=6A859557"}, {"file_name": "jimeng-2025-12-13-3954-\u53bb\u6389\u753b\u9762\u4e2d\u7684\u9f20\u6807\u7bad\u5934.png", "id": "836065415918924", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620940_836065419252257_206443966995562054_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6CWz4TLxOfMQ7kNvwGoO6tw&_nc_oc=AdqtFCebkuMs23hkOcFPozcSRp3FlCCxtCD5yQwdc_SWqkpCKFTnL7HeENt_pTiYn3I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFrZiICoInA-Hx5X5yFevS-fhErQhE7-7pCsRJaTO8Y_Q&oe=6A8583E4"}, {"file_name": "jimeng-2025-12-13-6748-\u53bb\u6389\u753b\u9762\u4e2d\u7684\u9f20\u6807\u7bad\u5934.png", "id": "3182153045297001", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619680_3182153051963667_392283180582857958_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kff9Er87sJcQ7kNvwHJ6rS6&_nc_oc=Adpxkg_SDrqeY7UVOUSYIgkjXi3MQKQxDnR4Sb624Dw__RlUlJoo4uPTV_AWZYkrKag&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGRDPJne2SbiV49nL4Io8MUlRLWlV6uSBR3myUJzCKEjQ&oe=6A859446"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "20251209-232136.png", "id": "1372267231286569", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619113_1372267234619902_275821156816171695_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xfUtKhfe9gQQ7kNvwFyXnuV&_nc_oc=Ado2iYQYryE5Oz5hNYSIavrw1oyFxa09oQ8QDQAiS0KdTcFl78DgTDnwFt3Mx43OjhE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE8VQ6d-CgmeWb0QdJ99rdKcK1VK2GxAxwdm_o-x9CdsA&oe=6A85ADFD"}, "display_name": "A Very Difficult Game About Walking", "keywords": ["simulator", "funny", "platformer", "challenge", "rage"], "long_description": "In a nutshell, this is unbelievably tough VR game\u2014all about the \u201csimple\u201d act of walking.\n\nYou\u2019ll be strapped into two wobbly AF giant stilts, controlling each one with a hand controller. Try not to panic (spoiler: you will), grab every star you can, and haul yourself to the next level before you faceplant into the ground.\n\nWe originally made this game because we thought stilt-walking in VR would be a total piece of cake. Spoiler #2: We were so wrong. It\u2019s straight-up hell\u2014but shockingly, the kind of hell that\u2019s weirdly addictive and hilarious.\n\nSo we cranked out 42 soul-crushing levels to share this chaotic torture with you. And we\u2019re not stopping there\u2014we\u2019ll keep dropping new levels to make this one-of-a-kind pain (and joy) last even longer. Don\u2019t stress (you\u2019ll definitely stress), you\u2019ve got this\u2026 hopefully you won\u2019t cry while \u201cwalking.\u201d\n", "short_description": "In short, this is an unbelievably difficult game about walking.\nYou will walk with two very shaky high stilts, control them with your two hands - try not to panic (spoiler: you will), collect the stars, enter the next level before you fall."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://skycamp-studio.github.io/Home/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Skycamp Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://skycamp-studio.github.io/Home/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "4